  "ui_html": "<div aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"modal fade show\" id=\"kt_modal_email_preview\" role=\"dialog\" style=\"display: block;\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl\">\n<div class=\"modal-content\">\n<div class=\"modal-header\">\n<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n<h2 class=\"fw-bold mb-1\" id=\"emailPreviewCampaignName\">Campaign - V2.0 \\u002D Launch</h2>\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-3\">\n<span class=\"text-muted fs-7\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-abstract-26 fs-7 me-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n                                Subject: <span class=\"fw-semibold text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSubject\">Your store is 1 click away (no, really)</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"text-muted fs-7\">\u00b7</span>\n<span class=\"text-muted fs-7\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-calendar fs-7 me-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n                                Sent: <span class=\"fw-semibold text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSentAt\">Apr 13, 2026 at 14:13</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn btn-icon btn-sm btn-active-icon-primary ms-auto\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-cross fs-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal-body p-0\">\n<!-- Toolbar -->\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center px-7 py-3 border-bottom border-gray-200 bg-light\">\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n<span class=\"badge badge-light-primary fs-8 px-3 py-2\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-sms fs-7 me-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n                                To: sidharth@likwid.co.in\n                            </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ms-auto d-flex gap-2\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light-primary\" id=\"emailPreviewToggle\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"ki-duotone ki-code fs-5\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span><span class=\"path3\"></span><span class=\"path4\"></span></i> View Source</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Rendered HTML view -->\n<div id=\"emailPreviewRendered\" style=\"min-height:400px; max-height:600px; overflow-y:auto;\">\n<!-- \u2705 FIX 1: Added \"allow-scripts\" to sandbox -->\n<!-- OLD: sandbox=\"allow-same-origin\" -->\n<!-- Without allow-scripts, the browser blocks ANY script inside the iframe,\n                             including inline <style> tags being applied, causing the email to render\n                             unstyled and throwing \"Blocked script execution\" in the console. -->\n<iframe id=\"emailPreviewIframe\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts\" srcdoc='&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n&lt;meta charset=\"utf-8\"&gt;\n&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n  body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #f4f4f4; }\n  .email-container { background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; }\n  .content-section { margin: 20px 0; word-break: break-word; }\n  a { color: #007bff; }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n  &lt;div class=\"email-container\"&gt;\n    &lt;div style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px;\"&gt;\n                         &lt;img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/likwid\\u002Dmedia/email_templates/logos/favicon\\u002D192x192.png?X\\u002DGoog\\u002DAlgorithm\\u003DGOOG4\\u002DRSA\\u002DSHA256\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DCredential\\u003Dlikwid\\u002Dapp\\u002Dalpha%40appspot.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260413%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DDate\\u003D20260413T141303Z\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DExpires\\u003D86400\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DSignedHeaders\\u003Dhost\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DSignature\\\" alt=\"Logo\" style=\"max-width:200px; height:auto;\" /&gt;\n                       &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=\"content-section\"&gt;We wanted to build something something for D2C founders as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Introducing Cogent Stores.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A complete, AI\\u002Dgenerated e\\u002Dcommerce store. Designed. Branded. Deployed.&lt;br&gt;In one click. Zero code required.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501&lt;br&gt;What makes Cogent different&lt;br&gt;\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Most store builders give you a blank canvas and expect you to figure out the rest.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We studied how real D2C brands actually look and feel and built 4 design archetypes that cover the majority of how brands want to show up:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\u2726 Luxury / Editorial: For premium brands where the aesthetic IS the product. Think slow scroll, editorial typography, brand\\u002Dfirst.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\u2726 Clean / Modern DTC: Product\\u002Dfirst, distraction\\u002Dfree. For brands confident enough to let the product do the talking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\u2726 Bold / Playful: High energy, brand personality front and center. Think Recess, by Humankind \u2014 brands you remember.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\u2726 Artisan / Warm: For handcrafted, story\\u002Ddriven businesses. Warm palettes, serif fonts, and the feel of something made with care.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You pick one. We generate the rest.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501&lt;br&gt;Here\\u0027s what you get out of the box&lt;br&gt;\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\u2192 Complete store design matched to your archetype&lt;br&gt;\u2192 Built for discoverability: on Google AND AI search&lt;br&gt;\u2192 Product catalog, homepage, checkout, all generated&lt;br&gt;\u2192 Single\\u002Dclick deployment with SSL included&lt;br&gt;\u2192 Backend fully managed. You just sell.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No developer. No Figma file. No 3\\u002Dweek timeline.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you\\u0027ve been sitting on a product idea waiting for \\u0022the right time\\u0022 to launch, this is that time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Talk soon,&lt;br&gt;Sidharth \\u0026 Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;P.S. \u2014 It works best when you have your brand colours, a logo, and a quick description of what you sell. That\\u0027s genuinely all you need.&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:30px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid #eee;\"&gt;\n                         &lt;a href=\"https://cogent.likwid.ai/\" style=\"display:inline-block; background-color:#007bff; color:#fff; padding:12px 30px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px; font-weight:bold;\"&gt;Launch Store&lt;/a&gt;\n                       &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;' style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 400px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; display: block; height: 580px;\">\n</iframe>\n</div>\n<!-- Raw source view (hidden by default) -->\n<div id=\"emailPreviewSource\" style=\"display:none; min-height:400px; max-height:600px; overflow-y:auto;\">\n<pre class=\"p-7 m-0 fs-7 text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSourceText\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap; word-break:break-all; background:#f8f9fa;\">We wanted to build something something for D2C founders as well.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AIntroducing Cogent Stores.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AA complete, AI\\u002Dgenerated e\\u002Dcommerce store. Designed. Branded. Deployed.\\u000D\\u000AIn one click. Zero code required.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000A\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\\u000D\\u000AWhat makes Cogent different\\u000D\\u000A\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AMost store builders give you a blank canvas and expect you to figure out the rest.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AWe studied how real D2C brands actually look and feel and built 4 design archetypes that cover the majority of how brands want to show up:\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000A\u2726 Luxury / Editorial: For premium brands where the aesthetic IS the product. Think slow scroll, editorial typography, brand\\u002Dfirst.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000A\u2726 Clean / Modern DTC: Product\\u002Dfirst, distraction\\u002Dfree. For brands confident enough to let the product do the talking.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000A\u2726 Bold / Playful: High energy, brand personality front and center. Think Recess, by Humankind \u2014 brands you remember.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000A\u2726 Artisan / Warm: For handcrafted, story\\u002Ddriven businesses. Warm palettes, serif fonts, and the feel of something made with care.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AYou pick one. We generate the rest.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000A\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\\u000D\\u000AHere\\u0027s what you get out of the box\\u000D\\u000A\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000A\u2192 Complete store design matched to your archetype\\u000D\\u000A\u2192 Built for discoverability: on Google AND AI search\\u000D\\u000A\u2192 Product catalog, homepage, checkout, all generated\\u000D\\u000A\u2192 Single\\u002Dclick deployment with SSL included\\u000D\\u000A\u2192 Backend fully managed. You just sell.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000ANo developer. No Figma file. No 3\\u002Dweek timeline.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AIf you\\u0027ve been sitting on a product idea waiting for \\u0022the right time\\u0022 to launch, this is that time.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000ATalk soon,\\u000D\\u000ASidharth \\u0026 Team\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AP.S. \u2014 It works best when you have your brand colours, a logo, and a quick description of what you sell. That\\u0027s genuinely all you need.</pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal-footer border-top border-gray-200 py-4\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-light\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" type=\"button\">Close</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
